<title>BELGIUM: U.K. Henderson holds 10 pct of Telinfo.</title>
<headline>U.K. Henderson holds 10 pct of Telinfo.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. investment company Henderson Investors Ltd holds 10.21 percent of Belgian data communications company Telinfo, according to a transparency notice published by the Brussels bourse on Thursday.</p>
<p>Henderson bought the shares during a restructuring of Telinfo's capital organised by its leading shareholders last week.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
